---
// IdeaPaths — tiny explainer of Polsia's bifurcated onboarding. Sign up, then
// either let the AI invent an idea or type your own; either way the bot posts
// it to @polsia as a startup pitch. Static HTML/CSS, theme-aware via --polsia-*.
---

<figure class="polsia-fig polsia-paths-fig">
    <div class="pp-flow">
        <div class="pp-stage">
            <span class="pp-node">You sign up for Polsia</span>
        </div>

        <div class="pp-arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</div>

        <div class="pp-fork" role="group" aria-label="two paths">
            <div class="pp-option">
                <span class="pp-badge">1</span>
                <span class="pp-option-text">Let the AI invent an idea for you</span>
            </div>
            <div class="pp-or" aria-hidden="true">or</div>
            <div class="pp-option">
                <span class="pp-badge">2</span>
                <span class="pp-option-text">Enter your own idea</span>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="pp-arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</div>

        <div class="pp-stage">
            <span class="pp-node pp-node-accent">@polsia auto-tweets it as a startup pitch</span>
        </div>
    </div>

    <figcaption class="pp-caption">
        Two ways an idea enters Polsia. Both end up as an auto-posted pitch, so this
        dataset mixes human-entered and machine-invented ideas.
    </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
    .polsia-paths-fig {
        margin: 1.5rem auto 2rem;
        max-width: 720px;
    }

    .pp-flow {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
        gap: 0.75rem;
        flex-wrap: nowrap;
    }

    .pp-node,
    .pp-option {
        font-family: var(--polsia-sans);
        font-size: 0.82rem;
        line-height: 1.3;
        color: var(--polsia-fg);
        background: var(--polsia-bg-alt);
        border: 1px solid var(--polsia-border);
        border-radius: 0.625rem;
        padding: 0.5rem 0.7rem;
    }

    .pp-node {
        display: inline-block;
        text-align: center;
    }

    .pp-node-accent {
        border-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--polsia-accent) 55%, var(--polsia-border));
        color: var(--polsia-fg-alt);
        font-weight: 600;
        background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--polsia-accent) 10%, var(--polsia-bg-alt));
    }

    .pp-fork {
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        gap: 0.4rem;
        align-items: stretch;
    }

    .pp-option {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 0.5rem;
    }

    .pp-badge {
        flex-shrink: 0;
        width: 1.3rem;
        height: 1.3rem;
        border-radius: 999px;
        background: var(--polsia-accent);
        color: #fff;
        font-size: 0.72rem;
        font-weight: 700;
        display: inline-flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
    }

    .pp-or {
        font-size: 0.7rem;
        font-style: italic;
        color: var(--polsia-fg-faint);
        text-align: center;
        padding-left: 1.8rem;
    }

    .pp-arrow {
        color: var(--polsia-fg-faint);
        font-size: 1.25rem;
        flex-shrink: 0;
        line-height: 1;
    }

    .pp-caption {
        margin-top: 0.85rem;
        text-align: center;
        font-size: 0.8rem;
        color: var(--polsia-fg-muted);
        max-width: 560px;
        margin-left: auto;
        margin-right: auto;
    }

    /* Stack vertically on narrow screens; arrows point down */
    @media (max-width: 640px) {
        .pp-flow {
            flex-direction: column;
            gap: 0.5rem;
        }
        .pp-arrow {
            transform: rotate(90deg);
        }
        .pp-fork {
            width: 100%;
        }
        .pp-node {
            display: block;
        }
        .pp-or {
            padding-left: 0;
        }
    }
</style>
